        {
          "review_id": "b03d6dc9-449a-4647-b112-559186656759",
          "excerpt": "Generally nice - but integrations buggy, offline mode USELESS, and moving storage failed and deleted everything. Ignores metered setting for WiFi which is a big pain! Fix this stuff and it'd be amazing as the ideas are great. Would be nice to be able to tune the suggestions algorithm as it either sticks to what you know or picks tracks it should know I don't like.",
